@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000
@accessToken = replace-with-developer-access-token

### Browse the latest nondeleted news by title
GET {{baseUrl}}/content-restrictions/browse/News?page=1&search=welcome
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Browse uploaded file names
GET {{baseUrl}}/content-restrictions/browse/VfsFile?page=1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Unsupported entity types return 400
GET {{baseUrl}}/content-restrictions/browse/HumanUser
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
